      "value": "I'm sure they're working on this, but there haven't been any updates on their progress lately. I know it almost absolutely looks like they gave up on the whole project, which is not the case, but the more it seems that way, the more reasons we have to assume they're too busy working on something extremely promising for the near future of VRChat.",
