      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5b9e755b4f08ba081fc5c83d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "For those of us who are Avatar creators, we always tend to find our avatar menus super cluttered with all our models that we dont want to delete. So heres my idea. How about just like the favorite friends categories, add 3 sections of avatar favorites so we can organize our avatars better. I personally have over 60 custom models and sometimes I have to slide my cursor for a whole minute just looking for an old avatar that I made months ago. Or if anything, let us reorganize our avatar menus our own way, like a click and drag. This would make it soooo much easier to get to our signature models, as well as our older models when we want a nostalgia trip XD",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Favorites system for custom avatars",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5b450d1974eab240078411c3",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
