  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-07-10T19:46:33.308Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Just like how we can favorite worlds, it would be super helpful and convenient if we could favorite avatars from public avatar worlds! In our avatar selection menu, we should have a \"favorite avatar\" button, and that avatar can appear in our public avatars section. That way, we won't have to keep going back and forth between worlds to get the avatar we want, or worse, some people even forget the world where they got a specific avatar. I really think this would be a great, helpful option for us! The avatars are already for public use, so why can't we just favorite them and save them to our public avatars section? Please, consider this new feature! Thank you!",
